    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Your rage comes from a deep and purely personal well within you. You use your rage as you choose.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Instinct Ability—Unstoppable Frenzy",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Increase the additional damage from Rage from 2 to 3. You gain a bonus 1st-level barbarian feat.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Specialization Ability",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "meta": "Level 7"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Increase the additional damage from Rage from 3 to 7. If you have greater weapon specialization, instead increase the additional damage from Rage to 13.",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "Raging Resistance",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "meta": "Level 9"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "You resist physical weapon damage, but not physical damage from other sources (such as unarmed attacks).",
